---
mm: 1.2
kind: sdk
name: linux-x86_64
target: x86_64-linux-gnu
compiler-family: gcc
runtime: glibc
platform-provider: platform.linux.map platform.linux.defaults
platform-provider: mm.stdio platform.linux.stdio
platform-provider: mm.mcu platform.linux.mcu
platform-provider: mm.rtc platform.linux.rtc
platform-provider: mm.display platform.linux.display
platform-provider: mm.touch platform.linux.touch
platform-provider: mm.imu platform.linux.imu
---

# Native x86-64 Linux SDK

The hosted x86-64 Linux lane. Native-runner validation prevents selecting it
on a build machine whose compiler reports a different target triple.
